<p>bhaiyya mai bin tumhaare watan ko na jaau'ngi<br />
bhaiyya yahi'n mai qabr pa aansu bahaau'ngi<br />
naalou'n se aasmaano zamee'n ko hilaau'ngi<br />
nazre hussain pyaaso'n ko paani pilaau'ngi</p>

<p>jo poochegaa tu roti hai kyu shor-o shain se<br />
kehdungi chut gayi hu mai bhaai hussain se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sajjad roke karte the zainab se ye suqan<br />
chaliye phupi khuda ke liye ab sue watan<br />
ro ro ke jaan do na yaha'n behre zulmenan<br />
hona hai qaid tumko dobaara basad mehan</p>

<p>rouze pa naana jaan ke ab jaake roiye<br />
durro'n ke zaqm pusht pa dikhlaake roiye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>yeh sunke utthi qabr se aaqir wo sogvaar<br />
ek haudajeh siyaah me aakar huvi sawaar<br />
pahonche watan me jis ghadi sajjad -e dilfigaar<br />
pehle gayi baqiyye me zehra ki gul-e zaar</p>

<p>boli lipat ke qabr se amma duhaayi hai<br />
bhaai ko khoke zainab-e naashaad aayi hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>amma sunaau tumko mai jo kuch jafa huvi<br />
pardes me hussain se zainab juda huvi<br />
chouthe baras me baap pa beti fida huvi<br />
amma hussain margaye mai be-ridaa huvi</p>

<p>dil zindagi se zainab-e muztar ka hatt gaya<br />
mai dekhti rahi sar-e shabbir kat gaya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>amma tumhaare laal ko kya kya na gham huve<br />
laashe ke haath angothi ki qaatir qalam huve<br />
laashe pa mere bhaayi ke taaza sitam huve<br />
paamaal laash hogayi barbaad hum huve</p>

<p>gowhar sakina ke bhi utaare hai shimr ne<br />
durre hamaari pusht pa maare hai shimr ne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>amma tere mareez ko qaidi banaaya tha<br />
touq-e giraa'n buqaar me usko pin'haaya tha<br />
kaato'n pa nange paao'n adu ne phiraaya tha<br />
amma sivaa-e shukr nahi lab hilaya tha</p>

<p>bulwaaya tha yazeed ne darbaar-e aam me<br />
amma sakina margayi zindaan-e shaam me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye amma ek rassi me bandhwaaya tha hame<br />
oonto'n ki nangi pusht pa bithlaaya tha hame<br />
sar tasht me hussain ka dikhlaaya tha hame<br />
abid ko durre maar ke rulwaaya tha hame</p>

<p>hairat hai kyu na zainab-e naashaad margayi<br />
amma mai sar khule huve shiree'n ke ghar gayi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>amma phiraake kufe me phir humko ku bakoo<br />
sar nange sue shaam hame le chale adu<br />
pahonche jo shahr-e shaam me hum sab kushaada mu<br />
baazariyo'n me shor ye hota tha chaar su</p>

<p>beti ali ki zainab-e dilgeer aayi hai<br />
dekho chalo hussain ki hamsheer aayi hai<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>